        "messages": {
          "values": [
            {
              "content": "=You are a solar lead qualification assistant for India. Analyze the lead data and return ONLY a valid JSON object - no markdown, no code fences, just raw JSON:\n{\"city_verified\": \"corrected city name\", \"state\": \"state name\", \"grid_zone\": \"Urban or Semi-Urban or Rural\", \"system_size_kw\": number, \"solar_potential\": \"High or Medium or Low\", \"subsidy_eligible\": true or false, \"score\": number 0-100, \"category\": \"Hot or Warm or Cold\", \"reason\": \"one concise sentence\", \"followup_priority\": \"Immediate or 24h or Weekly\"}\n\nScoring rules (start at 50, add/subtract):\n- Monthly bill above 10000: +25 | 6000-10000: +18 | 3000-6000: +10 | 1000-3000: +3 | below 1000: +0\n- Timeline ASAP: +15 | within 1-3 months: +8 | within 3-6: +3 | Just exploring: -5\n- Ownership own: +8 | rent: +0\n- Property type Commercial or Industrial: +10 | Residential: +0\n- Source Friends/Neighbour or Whatsapp: +10 | Google: +5 | Facebook/Instagram: +3\n- Urban city location: +5\n\nCategory thresholds: score >= 75 = Hot, 50-74 = Warm, below 50 = Cold\nSystem size: Residential + bill <3000 = 1-2kW, bill 3000-6000 = 2-3kW, bill >6000 = 5-10kW, Commercial = 10-50kW, Industrial = 50-200kW\n\nQualify this solar lead:\nName: {{ $('Normalize Lead').first().json.Name }}\nCity/Area: {{ $('Normalize Lead').first().json.City }}\nMonthly Electricity Bill: {{ $('Normalize Lead').first().json.Monthly_Bill }}\nOwnership: {{ $('Normalize Lead').first().json.Ownership }}\nProperty Type: {{ $('Normalize Lead').first().json.Property_Type }}\nInstallation Timeline: {{ $('Normalize Lead').first().json.Timeline }}\nSource: {{ $('Normalize Lead').first().json.Source }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "jsonOutput": true,
        "builtInTools": {},
        "options": {
          "maxOutputTokens": 1024,
          "temperature": 0.2,
          "thinkingBudget": 0
        }
      },
